OL,3,GNEWSA'This is the final offer,' says NI
OL,4,Asecretary over #1.5bn Stormont funding
OL,5,Apackage
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary of State
OL,8,Fhas said the government's #1.5bn
OL,9,Ffinancial package for Stormont is his
OL,10,F"final offer" and has given executive
OL,11,Fparties until next Thursday to respond.
OL,13,FSir Chris Bryant said there was "no
OL,14,Fmore money" available and that the
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland Executive needed to
OL,16,Fagree on a budget.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
