OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1790292351
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'This is the final offer,' says NI
OL,4,Asecretary over #1.5bn Stormont funding
OL,5,Apackage
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said he would have to consider
OL,8,F"every eventuality" if the executive
OL,9,Ffailed to reach an agreement, including
OL,10,Fthe possibility of a budget being
OL,11,Fpassed at Westminster but wanted to
OL,12,F"sit down and I'll be as cooperative as
OL,13,FI possibly can".
OL,15,FHowever some parties have criticised
OL,16,Fthe deadline with the DUP's Diane Dodds
OL,17,Fdescribing it as "reckless".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
